vCat12\"><a href=\"/submersible-drainage-pump\" id=\"6872868\">Submersible Drainage Pump</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item LiLevel1\" id=\"LeftNavCat13\"><a href=\"/sewage-submersible-pump\" id=\"6872872\">Sewage Submersible Pump</a><ul class=\"sub-menu\">\n<li class=\"LiLevel2\"><a href=\"/sewage-submersible-pump/ss-submersible-sewage-pump-with-float-switch\" id=\"6872928\">SS Submersible Sewage Pump with Float Switch</a></li>\n<li class=\"LiLevel2\"><a href=\"/sewage-submersible-pump/submersible-sewage-pump-with-grinder\" id=\"6872929\">Submersible Sewage Pump with Grinder</a></li>\n</ul></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item LiLevel1\" id=\"LeftNavCat14\"><a href=\"/self-suction-screw-pump\" id=\"6872880\">Self Suction Screw Pump</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item LiLevel1\" id=\"LeftNavCat15\"><a href=\"/submersible-solar-pump\" id=\"7719400\">Submersible Solar Pump</a></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"con_title\">Contact Us</div>\n<div class=\"contact_box\"><p>JD Frontier</p><p>ADD: City Saddar Road, Rawalpindi, Pakistan</p><p>TEL: <a href=\"tel:+92515553023\">051-5553023</a></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pro_right\">\n<div class=\"pror_wrap\">\n<div class=\"pror_detail\">\n<div class=\"fl\"><div class=\"singglepic\"><img alt=\"4 Inch Borehole Well Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/4-inch-diameter-submersible-pump48532389820.jpg\"/></div><link href=\"/images/spic.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\"/></div>\n<div class=\"fr\">\n<h1 class=\"title-h1\">4 Inch Borehole Well Submersible Pump</h1>\n<p>We supply 4 Inch Borehole Well Submersible Pump. Submersible pumps for domestic use, multistage type with floating radial impeller. Suitable for 4’’ wells. Designed to lift clear and clean water, they can be used both in agricultural field, for irrigation, and in the...</p>\n<a class=\"special_read\" href=\"#p1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"79422105\"/></p><p><strong>4 Inch Borehole Well Submersible Pump</strong><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231550192398898.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/></p><p>We supply 4 Inch Borehole Well Submersible Pump. Submersible pumps for domestic use, multistage type with floating radial impeller. Suitable for 4’’ wells. Designed to lift clear and clean water, they can be used both in agricultural field, for irrigation, and in the domestic and industrial field to pressurize the water supply with a pressure tank. Capacities from 0 to 16.5 m3/h, heads from 4 to 216 m. Maximum pump’s diameter 98 mm.</p><p><strong>1. Product Parameter (specification)</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Model Number</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">4SR10</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Structure</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Multistage Pump</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Motor Power Type</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Electric</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Body Material</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Stainless Steel</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Brand Name</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">JIADI</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">For use with what product?</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Water Well</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Max. Head</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">216m</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Q Max.</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">16.5m3/h</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Motor Power</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">0.55-7.5kW/ 0.75-10HP</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Max. Diameter</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">98 mm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Pump Length</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">775mm-3070mm in this series</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Outlet Connection Size</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">2 inches</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Voltage</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">220-240/380-415 volts, 50Hz</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Highest temperature water</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">35℃</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Warranty Description</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">One year</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image009(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231552173473426.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image005(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231550165383148.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/></strong></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Copper Motor </p><p><img alt=\"image011(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231556251086070.jpg\"/></p><p>·100% copper wire</p><p>·With food grade oil never pollute the water</p><p>·Lower temperature and longer lifespan for the motor</p><p><br/></p></td><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\">Plastic Impeller  <p><img alt=\"image013(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231556369780437.jpg\"/></p><p>·Bearing high flow rate and pressure</p><p>·Floating impeller design, avoid stuck</p><p><br/></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Stud/Nut/Screws </p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231556482859063.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image015(001).jpg\"/><img alt=\"image017(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231557051787526.jpg\"/></p><p>·Material: S/S 304</p><p>·Anti-rust</p><p><br/></p></td><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Impeller Intermediate Supporter </p><p><img alt=\"image019(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231557448859024.jpg\"/></p><p>·Material: PC</p><p>·Anti-high-temperature</p><p><br/></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>4. MOTOR</strong></p><p>Class F insulation IP 68 protection. Continuous duty</p><p>Single-phase feeding 220-240V with protection at user’s care</p><p>Three-phase feeding 380-415V with protection at user’s care</p><p><strong>5. Operating Application</strong></p><p>JIADI pumps are widely used in farm irrigation and drainage, factories, mines, construction, urban and rural household uses. Especially for pumping deep well underground water and transporting clean or dirty water.</p><p><img alt=\"image021(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231601535528865.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>6. About Warranty</strong></p><p>1. This warranty does not affect specific legal rights of a consumer.</p><p>2. We reserve the right to relinquish all responsibility under this warranty for repair if the pump is tampered with or damaged by other than authorized technician.</p><p>3. We are not liable to any damage with or damage to pump due to natural disaster. Such as fire, flood or earthquake.</p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: 4 inch borehole well submersible pump,